{
  "$comment": "Which original audio file becomes each sound the web app plays. Rebuild with: npm run audio [-- <name>]. src is relative to assets/. Output: apps/web/public/shared/audio/<name>.<format>, or apps/web/public/games/<game>/audio/ when 'game' is set (sounds used by one game only). 'unsorted': purpose not decided yet; kept in the old assets/audio/ and apps/web/public/audio/ folders. Optional: start = seconds cut from the beginning (quiet lead-in), duration = seconds kept, speed = playback rate (1.3 = 30% faster, same pitch), format = 'wav' for short effects (MP3 adds ~25 ms of silence at the start; WAV does not) or 'mp3' (default).",
